WEBVTT

00:02.044 --> 00:07.007
(BEES BUZZING)

00:10.135 --> 00:12.721
(BUZZING GROWS LOUDER)

00:20.020 --> 00:22.898
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

00:40.165 --> 00:44.670
TEDDY: It all starts
with something magnificent.

00:44.753 --> 00:46.630
(BUZZING CONTINUES)
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

00:46.713 --> 00:49.299
A flower.
Just a flower.

00:51.176 --> 00:53.845
Then, a honeybee.

00:55.138 --> 00:58.976
Very fragile.
Very complicated.

01:00.769 --> 01:03.647
The bee gathers pollen

01:04.565 --> 01:07.401
and deposits it in
another flower's stigma.

01:08.777 --> 01:11.780
It's like sex,
but cleaner.

01:11.863 --> 01:13.532
Nobody gets hurt.

01:13.615 --> 01:16.243
(CAPTIVATING MUSIC PLAYING)

01:25.419 --> 01:28.505
(MUSIC INCREASES IN TEMPO)

01:47.524 --> 01:51.903
A third of our food
is pollinated this way.

01:52.696 --> 01:54.823
You understand
the scope of that?

01:56.533 --> 01:58.493
That's how vital
the bees are, Don.

02:00.037 --> 02:01.246
And they're dying.

02:01.330 --> 02:03.332
(MUSIC DISTORTING)

02:03.415 --> 02:04.458
DON: Why?

02:05.417 --> 02:07.878
TEDDY: It's like we talked
about, cuz. Remember?

02:07.961 --> 02:10.631
CCD. It's like
a pandemic.

02:14.426 --> 02:17.095
Workers desert
the queen

02:18.221 --> 02:20.474
