with her young.

02:21.767 --> 02:24.019
And the colony
wastes away.

02:28.315 --> 02:31.026
DON: But why do they
leave her?

02:32.986 --> 02:34.613
TEDDY: Well... (GRUNTS)

02:34.696 --> 02:37.783
...people claim it's
pesticides or habitat loss.

02:37.866 --> 02:40.827
Or some people think
world governments

02:40.911 --> 02:43.288
and their
agro-corporate overlords

02:43.372 --> 02:46.750
