organizing principle at work.

02:56.176 --> 02:57.386
So I studied.

02:59.012 --> 03:00.097
I observed.

03:00.180 --> 03:01.598
Down.

03:01.682 --> 03:04.976
I searched in the ground
and in the stars.

03:06.311 --> 03:08.772
Until I found it.

03:08.855 --> 03:12.818
(ALARM BEEPS)
(OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING)

03:14.194 --> 03:16.405
