03:40.637 --> 03:42.472
to stop them.

03:45.434 --> 03:48.145
The training
is for a reason, Don.

03:48.228 --> 03:50.313
It's going to try
and dominate us.

03:50.397 --> 03:53.066
But we're not
gonna let it, are we?

03:53.150 --> 03:56.653
(STRAINING) You mean
she'll try to hurt us?

03:56.737 --> 03:59.364
TEDDY". Oh, yes, Don.
